From: nanana677777 <nanana677777@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 23:23:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add a pause option (tray menu + global hotkey) that skips the
 challenge

- tray menu: Pause PhraseLock (5 / 15 / 30 / 60 min) and Resume now;
  blue badge and "N min left" in the tooltip while paused
- optional global hotkey (Protection tab, off by default): pauses for a
  chosen number of minutes, pressed again resumes; also works while the
  lock screen is showing
- while paused nothing locks (unlock follow-up, --lock, idle lock) and a
  lock screen that is already showing closes
- pause kept in pause.json (survives restarts, never rebuilds the overlay),
  24 h maximum
- new hotkeys.py parser, tests/test_pause.py, changelog, README, TODO

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RZFPqstRpzNCMeWcrN5tRD
